    "detailed_description": "You wake up alone in the same place you always wake up: a small dive bar called Lethe's. Possessed by the vague sense that you need to be somewhere, you begin walking aimlessly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy does the inside your mouth taste like burnt plastic?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy won't she stop crying?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy is the faint whine of an old television getting louder?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Path of Veins is a horror visual novel where the player navigates the narrative through choices. The narrative is conveyed to the player through text, sound, still images and video. The game features a fully scored, unique soundtrack for every scene and an evolving game ambience/soundscape. The currently playable version is approximately one-third of the intended final game and takes approximately 1-2 hours, depending on choices and play style. The game uses a manual save system. Because the focus is on narrative there are no &quot;achievements&quot; or other distractions. Interface during gameplay is kept to a bare minimum to enhance immersion.",
    "about_the_game": "You wake up alone in the same place you always wake up: a small dive bar called Lethe's. Possessed by the vague sense that you need to be somewhere, you begin walking aimlessly.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy does the inside your mouth taste like burnt plastic?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy won't she stop crying?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy is the faint whine of an old television getting louder?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Path of Veins is a horror visual novel where the player navigates the narrative through choices. The narrative is conveyed to the player through text, sound, still images and video. The game features a fully scored, unique soundtrack for every scene and an evolving game ambience/soundscape. The currently playable version is approximately one-third of the intended final game and takes approximately 1-2 hours, depending on choices and play style. The game uses a manual save system. Because the focus is on narrative there are no &quot;achievements&quot; or other distractions. Interface during gameplay is kept to a bare minimum to enhance immersion.",
    "short_description": "I have seen the face. Amongst the small white bones wrapped in fabric. Beneath the veins leading to the goddess. Within the black blood of the eucharist.",
